    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to present 1 Beechmount Crescent, Navan, Co. Meath to the market . This property is a very spacious four / five bedroom  house located in Beechmount Crescent in the heart of Navan Town. The property has been upgraded and maintained by the current owners.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor consists of an entrance foyer, a living area, an open plan kitchen / dining room, laundry / utility room, a family  living room, a bathroom and a ground floor office that could be used as downstairs bedroom. The first floor consists of four spacious bedrooms, a family bathroom and a hot press / utility closet. With the property extending to an overall size of 152 sqm, there is more than enough space for a comfortable lifestyle.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a private south-facing garden, featuring a tiled patio area and a generous lawn. The home is positioned on a desirable corner site, offering an excellent degree of privacy and creating an ideal outdoor space for relaxing.\r\n\r\n1 Beechmount Crescent is ideally located within walking distance to many amenities which Navan has to offer such as Navan Town Centre, Pairc Tailteann, numerous primary and secondary schools and much more. The home is a 30 minute drive from Blanchardstown, 40 minutes from Dublin City Centre and 40 minutes from Dublin Airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Situated on a large private corner site.\r\nExtremely spacious throughout extending to 152 square meters.\r\nPresented in very good condition throughout.\r\nLocated within walking distance to all local amenities.\r\nSouth facing rear garden."
      },
